{"ancestors": "0", "bizKey": "9118403", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2026-03-20 14:54:55", "detail": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>欧洲阳台光伏介绍</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 14px;\"><strong>美伊冲突对欧洲阳台光伏是强催化，核心逻辑是：油气暴涨 → 电价飙升 → 阳台光储经济性与刚需度暴增 → 欧洲订单与渗透率加速爆发。</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://super-data-middle-platform.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image/2026/03/20/e7a8a374-330e-49fa-a950-af037c3cb336.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">欧洲阳台光伏（Balcony PV）是指安装在公寓阳台、功率通常 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><strong>≤800W</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><strong>即插即用</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小型光储系统，核心由 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><strong>整机系统、微型逆变器、专用储能电芯</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 三大环节构成。A 股公司凭借 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><strong>成本、技术、交付</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 三大优势，已主导全球供应链。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://super-data-middle-platform.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image/2026/03/20/d293a4fb-6fd4-4f79-addc-7f196969c4f0.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 478.00px;height: 375.92px;\"/><img src=\"https://super-data-middle-platform.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image/2026/03/20/b688ebf3-f47c-4fd8-8942-62fb02e28068.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 466.00px;height: 457.92px;\"/></p>", "firstLetter": "OZYTGF", "imgUrl": "", "importance": 1, "level": 1, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "欧洲阳台光伏", "parentId": 0, "pctChg": -3.09, "reason": "美伊冲突对欧洲阳台光伏是强催化，核心逻辑是：油气暴涨 → 电价飙升 → 阳台光储经济性与刚需度暴增 → 欧洲订单与渗透率加速爆发。", "remark": null, "sort": 1, "status": "1", "subjectId": 